

 Minutes of FIGGY BAR RT Conference.

Date: 02/28/91   Time: 22:32EST

    FIGGY BAR of 28 February 1991. Most of the discussion centered on how
   to coordinate several programmers, organizing effort and obtaining good
   results, then shifted to writing a parser in Forth to read and handle
   dBase created .NDX files. Some discussion of Pygmy.

